let __v_987 = Value::from("Say it as your own feeling about one thing, not a list: 'When you said that in front of everyone, it stung and I have been thinking about it.' Then say what you would like instead - 'I would rather you told me on my own' - and leave it there; a question at the end, like 'did you mean it that way?', keeps the door open. Soon and in private beats saving it up, and face to face beats a text if you can manage it.");
