let __v_1009 = Value::from("Then say that plainly and kindly, once, without a reason they have to argue with: \"I like you as a friend - I didn't want to leave you guessing.\" Keep it short, and be normal with them the next day, which is what makes it land as respect rather than a brush-off.");
