let __v_1010 = Value::from("Name the thing and the day, then stop talking: \"I've liked talking to you this week - do you want to get a coffee on Saturday?\" A specific plan is far easier to say yes to than \"sometime\", and a plain message you thought about for a minute beats a clever one. If it is a no, take it as an answer and be normal the next day: that is what keeps the friendship and your dignity.");
