let __v_1108 = Value::from("Send one small, specific message - a photo with a line on it ('saw this and thought of you - how are you doing?'), or a question only they would know the answer to - and then leave it. {reason}One warm message is easy to answer where three is a job. If there is no reply, wait a month, then try once more and let it rest; a friendship that needs chasing that often is telling you something.");
