let __v_7815 = Value::from("Everything within reach first - a fresh nappy, wipes or a damp flannel, a nappy sack and a clean vest - and one hand on the baby the whole time if you are on a raised surface. Unfasten the tabs and fold the front down out of the way, wipe front to back with the old nappy still underneath you, lift both legs by the ankles to clean underneath, then slide the fresh nappy under with the tabs at the back and do it up level with the waist, frills out.");
